<title>FRANCE: Highlights of ONIC maize estimates.</title>
<headline>Highlights of ONIC maize estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cereals office ONIC's monthly maize estimates (July/June, million tonnes). *Revisions for 95/96.</p>
<p>			    96/97(Nov) 96/97 (Oct)     95/96</p>
<p> Opening stocks	 1.653     1.653	     1.671</p>
<p> Harvested crop	13.624    13.663	    12.394</p>
<p> Use on farms	   1.994     1.943	    *1.960</p>
<p> Other domestic use   3.374     3.275	    *2.979</p>
<p>  - incl. animal feed 2.300     2.200	     1.917</p>
<p> Exports to EU	  5.620     5.600	     6.087</p>
<p> Non-EU exports	 0.250   0.250-1.250	 0.164</p>
<p> Final stocks	   2.741   2.000-3.000	 1.653</p>
</text>
